{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/25391","id":3688894775,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLCAjRs7b4BE3","html_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25391","diff_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25391.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25391.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25391","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/25391/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/25391/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25391/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/statuses/2272bc1870314c7396f5ab91e35d4ef7ea2846e1","number":25391,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Support DeepSeek V4 DeepEP Waterfill","user":{"login":"xutizhou","id":185465032,"node_id":"U_kgDOCw34yA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185465032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou","html_url":"https://github.com/xutizhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xutizhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds DeepSeek V4 support for DeepEP Waterfill:\r\n\r\n- keep shared-expert fusion enabled for DeepSeek V4 when `--enable-deepep-waterfill` is set, so the shared expert can be dispatched through DeepEP as the extra Waterfill expert\r\n- prepare both `TopK` and V4 `HashTopK` modules with `DeepEPWaterfillBalancer`\r\n- add Waterfill expansion support to `HashTopK`\r\n- record DeepSeek V4 expert distribution with layer context for EPLB placement\r\n- align the Waterfill path with logical/physical expert IDs and redundant physical experts\r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n\r\nThis PR depends on the following bugfix PRs and should be reviewed/landed after them:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25285\r\n- https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25367\r\n\r\nThe branch currently carries compatible changes needed to validate the V4 Waterfill path on current `main`; once the two bugfix PRs land, this PR should be rebased so the dependency diff disappears.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n\r\nTwo-node H20 DeepSeek V4 FP8 Waterfill perf sanity:\r\n\r\n- no-red, 8 rounds, batch=512, concurrency=128: baseline `46028 tok/s`, Waterfill `47224 tok/s`, `+2.60%`\r\n- red16, batch=512, concurrency=128: baseline `48666 tok/s`, Waterfill `50049 tok/s`, `+2.84%`\r\n- red32, batch=512, concurrency=128: baseline `48538 tok/s`, Waterfill `50630 tok/s`, `+4.31%`\r\n- no-red MMLU, 1000 examples: baseline score `0.878`, Waterfill score `0.876`; output throughput `892.9 tok/s` -> `902.6 tok/s`\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #26424785855](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/26424785855)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #26424811032](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/26424811032)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->","labels":[{"id"